<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-ASIATIC 6-MTH NET UP 47 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ASIATIC 6-MTH NET UP 47 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 27.88	vs     18.97</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)    3.76	vs	2.56</p>
<p>    Revenue		   110.95	vs     94.24</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   40.23	vs     26.90</p>
<p>    Dividend     (cents)    1.5	 vs	1.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Asiatic Development Bhd is a plantations and property concern and is a unit of Genting Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
